WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:07.278
Two hundred wooden crates in the warehouse, chalk numbers on the side, and a spreadsheet deciding who gets billed.

2
00:00:09.078 --> 00:00:13.382
With reloops Warehouse and Crate Storage, every crate is tracked and billed on time.

3
00:00:15.182 --> 00:00:19.686
Take goods straight from the move into store: press Move to Storage on any booked job.

4
00:00:20.486 --> 00:00:28.264
Pick your store and four wooden crates at two hundred and fifty cubic feet each, then save it for the crew with zero re-typing.

5
00:00:30.064 --> 00:00:34.756
At the warehouse, your crew scan crates one-oh-four to one-oh-seven in the Field App.

6
00:00:35.556 --> 00:00:43.086
Each crate’s exact row, position, and stack height is logged in seconds: Row B, Position 4, Level 2.

7
00:00:44.886 --> 00:00:51.408
Back in the office, the live Warehouse Map shows every row, every bay, and stack level at a glance.

8
00:00:52.208 --> 00:00:57.999
See every customer’s crates, spot free spaces, and check what is inside each crate in seconds.

9
00:00:59.799 --> 00:01:04.484
Set sixty pounds per crate a month including VAT, and each account bills one clear way.

10
00:01:05.284 --> 00:01:11.444
Charge a saved card automatically by subscription, or run monthly invoices with Direct Debit.

11
00:01:13.244 --> 00:01:19.182
Every crate tracked, and billed on time. Visit reloops.co to book a fifteen-minute call.
